Marne Ke Liye Jaata Hai Bhai Tera Zainab<br>
<br>
har Simt Se Maa Jaaya Tera Ghir Gaya Zainab<br>
<br>
1. Tum Janti Ho Khaime Me Ab Koi Nahi Hai<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
abbas Nahi Qasim-o-akbar Bhi Nahi Hai<br>
-behna Meri Behna<br>
besheer Ki Mayyat Bhi Mai Dafna Chuka Zainab<br>
<br>
2. Kis Tarha Sambhale Dile Bechain Ko Laila<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
woh Bhool Nahi Payegi Akbar Ka Kaleja<br>
behna Meri Behna<br>
uske Dil-e-muztar Ko Bhi Do Hausla Zainab<br>
<br>
3. Besheer Ki Maa Baithi Hai Jhoole Ko Sambhale<br>
behna Meri Behna<br>
sab Loriya'n Chup Hogayin Hotou'n Pe Hain Naale<br>
behna Meri Behna<br>
chehre Pe Mere Khoon Hai Besheer Ka Zainab<br>
<br>
4. Ab Sookhe Gale Par Mere Chal Jayega Khanjar<br>
behna Meri Behna<br>
le Janaa Hai Sajjad Ko Sholou'n Se Bachakar<br>
-behna Meri Behna<br>
ab Zulm Ka Andaaz Badal Jayega Zainab<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Beenayi Meri Legaye Sab Ghar Ke Ujaale<br>
behna Meri Behna<br>
ab Khaak Pe Sote Hain Meri Godh Ke Paale<br>
-behna Meri Behna<br>
yeh Dekhte Hi Dekhte Kya Hogaya Zainab<br>
<br>
6. Hojayenge Ab Zulm Ke Andaaz Niraale<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
jo Reh Gaye Khaime Me Woh Hain Tere Hawale<br>
-behna Meri Behna<br>
ab Farz Ada Karna Hai Abbas Ka Zainab<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Jal Jayenge Khaime Toh Bikhar Jayenge Bache<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
ek Jaa'n Tumhe Karne Hain Yeh Tasbeeh Ke Daane<br>
behna Meri Behna<br>
maqtal Me Nikalna Hai Tujhe Berida Zainab<br>
<br>
8. Aada Mere Bachi Pe Bohat Zulm Karenge<br>
-behna Meri Behna<br>
mazlooma Ko Masooma Ko Marenge Tamache<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
hai Sakht Masayeb Ka Tumhe Saamna Zainab<br>
<br>
9. Bikhre Huve Sab Khoo'n Bhare Manzar Hai Nazar Me<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
rukta Hi Nahi Fikr Ka Taa'er Hai Safar Me<br>
- Behna Meri Behna<br>
maange Hai Rasheed Aapse Ab Hausla Zainab